---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import LangToggle from '../../../components/LangToggle.astro';

// Qwen3.5-27B text_config (verified from HF Qwen/Qwen3.5-27B config.json, 2026-07-04):
// 64 layers, layer_types = 16 × [linear, linear, linear, full];
// full attention: 24 Q / 4 KV heads × head_dim 256, attn_output_gate, partial_rotary 0.25;
// linear (Gated DeltaNet): 16 K / 48 V heads × 128, conv kernel 4, mamba_ssm_dtype float32;
// hidden 5,120; FFN 17,408 dense (mlp_only_layers []); vocab 248,320; native ctx 262,144.
const NL = 64;
const layers = Array.from({ length: NL }, (_, i) => {
  const full = (i + 1) % 4 === 0; // indices 3, 7, …, 63 are full_attention
  const n = i + 1;
  return {
    i,
    full,
    tipEn: full
      ? `Layer ${n} — Gated Attention (full, GQA). 24 Q / 4 KV heads × 256; softmax over the whole prefix; KV cache +4 KB per token per layer — grows with T. Then dense SwiGLU FFN 5,120 → 17,408.`
      : `Layer ${n} — Gated DeltaNet (linear). q/k: 16 heads × 128, v: 48 heads × 128; recurrent state 48 × 128 × 128 fp32 ≈ 3 MB — constant in T. Then dense SwiGLU FFN 5,120 → 17,408.`,
    tipKo: full
      ? `Layer ${n} — Gated Attention (full, GQA). 24 Q / 4 KV heads × 256; 전체 prefix에 softmax; KV cache가 layer당 token마다 +4 KB — T에 비례해 증가. 이후 dense SwiGLU FFN 5,120 → 17,408.`
      : `Layer ${n} — Gated DeltaNet (linear). q/k 16 heads × 128, v 48 heads × 128; recurrent state 48 × 128 × 128 fp32 ≈ 3 MB — T와 무관하게 고정. 이후 dense SwiGLU FFN 5,120 → 17,408.`,
  };
});
---

<Base
  title="Hybrid attention anatomy: Qwen3.5 — Junwon Lee"
  description="Interactive tear-down of Qwen3.5's hybrid linear + full attention stack: the 3:1 Gated DeltaNet / Gated Attention interleave, both token mixers tensor by tensor, and the KV-cache-vs-recurrent-state memory race."
>
  <div class="hyb-page">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Study · Model anatomy</p>
        <h1>
          <span class="lang-en">Inside Qwen3.5: a hybrid linear + full attention LLM</span>
          <span class="lang-ko">Qwen3.5 해부: linear + full attention 하이브리드 LLM</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="lede">
          <span class="lang-en">
            Qwen3.5 answers the KV-cache problem architecturally: three of every four layers
            replace softmax attention with a <em>Gated DeltaNet</em> whose memory is a fixed-size
            matrix, and the remaining fourth keeps full attention as random-access memory over the
            context. Walk the 64-layer interleave, open both token mixers, then race their memory
            footprints out to 262K tokens.
          </span>
          <span class="lang-ko">
            Qwen3.5는 KV cache 문제를 아키텍처로 푼다: 4개 layer 중 3개는 softmax attention을
            고정 크기 행렬 메모리를 갖는 <em>Gated DeltaNet</em>으로 대체하고, 나머지 1개는 컨텍스트
            전체를 임의 접근(random-access)할 수 있는 full attention으로 남겨 둔다. 64-layer
            인터리브를 훑고, 두 token mixer를 열어 본 뒤, 262K token까지 메모리 경주를 돌려 보자.
          </span>
        </p>

        <div class="toggle-row"><LangToggle /></div>

        <div class="jump-row">
          <a class="tag" href="#stack-view">1 · Layer-stack map</a>
          <a class="tag" href="#mixer-view">2 · Two mixers</a>
          <a class="tag" href="#memory-view">3 · Memory race</a>
          <a class="tag" href="#why-view">4 · Why hybridize</a>
        </div>

        <div class="config-note">
          <span class="config-lead">
            <span class="lang-en">Config on this page — Qwen3.5-27B (dense), read from the
            published <code>config.json</code> on 2026-07-04:</span>
            <span class="lang-ko">이 페이지의 config — Qwen3.5-27B (dense), 공개
            <code>config.json</code>에서 2026-07-04에 직접 확인:</span>
          </span>
          <span class="tag accent">64 layers = 16 × (3 linear + 1 full)</span>
          <span class="tag">d_model 5,120</span>
          <span class="tag">full: 24 Q / 4 KV heads × 256</span>
          <span class="tag">linear: 16 K / 48 V heads × 128</span>
          <span class="tag">FFN 17,408 (dense SwiGLU)</span>
          <span class="tag">vocab 248,320</span>
          <span class="tag accent">native ctx 262,144</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ 1 · LAYER-STACK MAP ============ -->
    <section class="section-tight" id="stack-view">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="viz-h">
          <span class="lang-en">1 · The layer stack: 48 linear + 16 full</span>
          <span class="lang-ko">1 · 레이어 스택: linear 48 + full 16</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="viz-sub">
          <span class="lang-en">The whole depth as one strip — exactly the
            <code>layer_types</code> list from the config. Hover any layer for its mixer and
            shapes; click to open the mixer internals below.</span>
          <span class="lang-ko">모델 전체 깊이를 한 줄로 — config의 <code>layer_types</code>
            리스트 그대로다. layer에 hover하면 mixer 종류와 shape가 보이고, 클릭하면 아래
            mixer 내부로 이동한다.</span>
        </p>

        <div class="viz-frame">
          <div class="hyb-scroll">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 740 208" role="img" aria-label="Qwen3.5-27B layer stack: 64 layers, repeating 3 Gated DeltaNet then 1 Gated Attention, each followed by a dense SwiGLU FFN" style="width:100%; height:auto; min-width:720px;">
            <text class="stitle" x="20" y="20">layer_types — 16 × ( 3 × Gated DeltaNet → 1 × Gated Attention )</text>

            {layers.map((l) => (
              <a href="#mixer-view" class="cell-link" aria-label={`Layer ${l.i + 1}: ${l.full ? 'Gated Attention (full)' : 'Gated DeltaNet (linear)'}`}>
                <rect
                  class={`lcell ${l.full ? 'lc-full' : 'lc-lin'}`}
                  x={18 + l.i * 11} y="38" width="9" height="46" rx="2"
                  data-tip={l.tipEn} data-tip-ko={l.tipKo}
                ></rect>
              </a>
            ))}

            {[1, 16, 32, 48, 64].map((n) => (
              <text class="mlabel" x={18 + (n - 1) * 11 + 4.5} y="98" text-anchor="middle">{n}</text>
            ))}

            <!-- block braces every 4 layers -->
            {Array.from({ length: 16 }, (_, b) => (
              <rect x={18 + b * 44} y="86" width="42" height="2" rx="1" fill={b % 2 ? '#d1cfc5' : '#b9b7ad'}></rect>
            ))}

            <g data-tip="Every one of the 64 layers is followed by the same dense SwiGLU FFN: gate/up 5,120 → 17,408, down 17,408 → 5,120. mlp_only_layers is empty and there are no MoE params in the 27B config — the MoE variants live elsewhere in the family (e.g. Qwen3.5-397B-A17B)."
               data-tip-ko="64개 layer 전부 동일한 dense SwiGLU FFN이 뒤따른다: gate/up 5,120 → 17,408, down 17,408 → 5,120. 27B config에는 mlp_only_layers가 비어 있고 MoE 파라미터가 없다 — MoE는 패밀리의 다른 모델(예: Qwen3.5-397B-A17B) 몫이다.">
              <rect class="sbox sbox-warm" x="18" y="110" width="704" height="30" rx="7"></rect>
              <text class="ssub" x="370" y="129" text-anchor="middle">× 64 — dense SwiGLU FFN after every mixer: 5,120 → 17,408 → 5,120 (no MoE in the 27B config)</text>
            </g>

            <g transform="translate(18, 160)">
              <rect class="lcell lc-lin" x="0" y="0" width="12" height="12" rx="2"></rect>
              <text class="ssub" x="18" y="10">Gated DeltaNet (linear) × 48 — state 3 MB/layer, constant</text>
              <rect class="lcell lc-full" x="330" y="0" width="12" height="12" rx="2"></rect>
              <text class="ssub" x="348" y="10">Gated Attention (full, GQA) × 16 — KV +4 KB/token/layer</text>
            </g>
            <text class="smono" x="18" y="196">full_attention_interval: 4 → 75% of the stack never touches the KV cache</text>
          </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ 2 · TWO MIXERS ============ -->
    <section class="section-tight" id="mixer-view">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="viz-h">
          <span class="lang-en">2 · The two token mixers, side by side</span>
          <span class="lang-ko">2 · 두 token mixer 나란히 보기</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="viz-sub">
          <span class="lang-en">Same input, same output shape, opposite memory contracts. Hover
            every box for the exact op and its cost.</span>
          <span class="lang-ko">입력도 출력 shape도 같지만 메모리 계약은 정반대다. 각 박스에
            hover하면 정확한 연산과 비용이 보인다.</span>
        </p>

        <div class="viz-frame">
          <div class="mixer-grid">
            <!-- ===== full attention ===== -->
            <div>
              <div class="mixer-head mh-full">
                <span class="lang-en">Gated Attention — full softmax · × 16 layers</span>
                <span class="lang-ko">Gated Attention — full softmax · 16개 layer</span>
              </div>
              <div class="hyb-scroll">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 440 660" role="img" aria-label="Gated Attention block: RMSNorm, GQA projections 24 Q and 4 KV heads of 256 dims, partial RoPE, softmax attention over the KV cache, sigmoid output gate, output projection" style="width:100%; height:auto; min-width:400px;">
                <defs>
                  <marker id="arrH" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6.5" markerHeight="6.5" orient="auto-start-reverse">
                    <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#87857c"></path>
                  </marker>
                </defs>

                <g data-tip="Hidden states entering the mixer." data-tip-ko="mixer로 들어오는 hidden states.">
                  <rect class="sbox" x="100" y="12" width="240" height="40" rx="9"></rect>
                  <text class="stitle" x="220" y="29" text-anchor="middle">X — hidden states</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="220" y="45" text-anchor="middle">[L × 5,120] BF16</text>
                </g>
                <line class="flowline" x1="220" y1="52" x2="220" y2="68" marker-end="url(#arrH)"></line>

                <g data-tip="Pre-norm RMSNorm before the projections." data-tip-ko="projection 앞의 pre-norm RMSNorm.">
                  <rect class="sbox sbox-warm" x="100" y="70" width="240" height="30" rx="8"></rect>
                  <text class="stitle sm" x="220" y="89" text-anchor="middle">RMSNorm</text>
                </g>

                <path class="flowline-thin" d="M220,100 V114 H74 V128" fill="none"></path>
                <line class="flowline-thin" x1="220" y1="114" x2="220" y2="128"></line>
                <path class="flowline-thin" d="M220,114 H366 V128" fill="none"></path>

                <g data-tip="W_Q: 5,120 → 24 heads × 256 = 6,144 (31.5 M weights)." data-tip-ko="W_Q: 5,120 → 24 heads × 256 = 6,144 (가중치 31.5 M).">
                  <rect class="sbox" x="12" y="130" width="124" height="58" rx="9"></rect>
                  <text class="stitle sm" x="74" y="150" text-anchor="middle">W_Q 5120→6144</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="74" y="166" text-anchor="middle">24 heads × 256</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="74" y="180" text-anchor="middle">31.5 M</text>
                </g>
                <g data-tip="W_K: 5,120 → 4 KV heads × 256 = 1,024 (5.24 M). GQA: one K head serves 6 query heads." data-tip-ko="W_K: 5,120 → 4 KV heads × 256 = 1,024 (5.24 M). GQA: K head 하나가 query head 6개를 담당.">
                  <rect class="sbox" x="158" y="130" width="124" height="58" rx="9"></rect>
                  <text class="stitle sm" x="220" y="150" text-anchor="middle">W_K 5120→1024</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="220" y="166" text-anchor="middle">4 KV heads × 256</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="220" y="180" text-anchor="middle">5.24 M</text>
                </g>
                <g data-tip="W_V: 5,120 → 4 KV heads × 256 = 1,024 (5.24 M). K and V are what the cache stores — 4 KB per token per layer in BF16." data-tip-ko="W_V: 5,120 → 4 KV heads × 256 = 1,024 (5.24 M). cache에 저장되는 것이 바로 K와 V — BF16 기준 layer당 token마다 4 KB.">
                  <rect class="sbox" x="304" y="130" width="124" height="58" rx="9"></rect>
                  <text class="stitle sm" x="366" y="150" text-anchor="middle">W_V 5120→1024</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="366" y="166" text-anchor="middle">4 KV heads × 256</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="366" y="180" text-anchor="middle">5.24 M</text>
                </g>

                <line class="flowline-thin" x1="74" y1="188" x2="74" y2="206"></line>
                <line class="flowline-thin" x1="220" y1="188" x2="220" y2="206"></line>

                <g data-tip="Partial RoPE: partial_rotary_factor 0.25 — only the first 64 of 256 dims per head are rotated (rope_theta 10,000,000)." data-tip-ko="Partial RoPE: partial_rotary_factor 0.25 — head당 256 dims 중 앞 64 dims만 회전 (rope_theta 10,000,000).">
                  <rect class="sbox sbox-warm" x="12" y="208" width="270" height="28" rx="8"></rect>
                  <text class="ssub" x="147" y="226" text-anchor="middle">partial RoPE — first 64 / 256 dims of Q, K</text>
                </g>

                <line class="flowline" x1="147" y1="236" x2="147" y2="260" marker-end="url(#arrH)"></line>
                <line class="flowline" x1="366" y1="188" x2="366" y2="260" marker-end="url(#arrH)"></line>

                <g data-tip="Softmax attention over the full prefix: every past token's K/V must be kept. Cost per query grows with T; the KV cache is the price of exact, position-addressable recall." data-tip-ko="prefix 전체에 대한 softmax attention: 과거 모든 token의 K/V를 보관해야 한다. query당 비용이 T에 비례해 증가 — KV cache는 정확한 위치 지정 recall의 대가다.">
                  <rect class="sbox sbox-accent" x="30" y="262" width="380" height="74" rx="11"></rect>
                  <text class="stitle taccent" x="220" y="284" text-anchor="middle">softmax attention (causal)</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="220" y="303" text-anchor="middle">softmax(Q Kᵀ / √256 + M) V → [L × 24 × 256]</text>
                  <text class="ssub" x="220" y="321" text-anchor="middle">reads ALL cached K/V — 1 KV head : 6 Q heads</text>
                </g>

                <!-- KV cache side chip -->
                <g data-tip="KV cache per layer: 2 (K,V) × 4 heads × 256 × 2 B = 4,096 B per token. It grows linearly with context length T." data-tip-ko="layer당 KV cache: 2 (K,V) × 4 heads × 256 × 2 B = token당 4,096 B. context 길이 T에 선형으로 증가.">
                  <rect class="kv-chip" x="284" y="344" width="146" height="46" rx="9"></rect>
                  <text class="stitle sm taccent" x="357" y="363" text-anchor="middle">KV cache</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="357" y="380" text-anchor="middle">+4 KB / token — grows</text>
                </g>
                <path class="loopline" d="M366,336 V344" marker-end="url(#arrH)"></path>

                <line class="flowline" x1="147" y1="336" x2="147" y2="398" marker-end="url(#arrH)"></line>

                <g data-tip="Output gate (attn_output_gate: true in config): a sigmoid gate g projected from the same input, applied elementwise to the attention output before W_O — the 'Gated' in Gated Attention." data-tip-ko="Output gate (config의 attn_output_gate: true): 같은 입력에서 projection한 sigmoid gate g를 attention 출력에 elementwise 적용한 뒤 W_O로 — Gated Attention의 'Gated'가 이것.">
                  <rect class="sbox sbox-warm" x="40" y="400" width="240" height="42" rx="9"></rect>
                  <text class="stitle sm" x="160" y="418" text-anchor="middle">output gate — σ(g) ⊙ out</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="160" y="434" text-anchor="middle">g: [L × 6,144]</text>
                </g>
                <line class="flowline" x1="160" y1="442" x2="160" y2="462" marker-end="url(#arrH)"></line>

                <g data-tip="W_O: 6,144 → 5,120 (31.5 M weights). Concatenated head outputs back to d_model." data-tip-ko="W_O: 6,144 → 5,120 (가중치 31.5 M). head 출력을 이어 붙여 d_model로 복원.">
                  <rect class="sbox" x="40" y="464" width="240" height="42" rx="9"></rect>
                  <text class="stitle sm" x="160" y="482" text-anchor="middle">W_O — [6,144 × 5,120]</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="160" y="498" text-anchor="middle">→ [L × 5,120] · 31.5 M</text>
                </g>
                <line class="flowline" x1="160" y1="506" x2="160" y2="526" marker-end="url(#arrH)"></line>

                <g data-tip="Every layer — linear or full — is followed by the same dense SwiGLU FFN." data-tip-ko="linear든 full이든 모든 layer 뒤에는 동일한 dense SwiGLU FFN이 온다.">
                  <rect class="sbox sbox-warm" x="40" y="528" width="240" height="42" rx="9"></rect>
                  <text class="stitle sm" x="160" y="546" text-anchor="middle">dense SwiGLU FFN</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="160" y="562" text-anchor="middle">5,120 → 17,408 → 5,120</text>
                </g>

                <text class="smono" x="220" y="606" text-anchor="middle">memory that scales with context: KV cache — 4 KB × T per layer</text>
                <text class="smono taccent" x="220" y="626" text-anchor="middle">16 layers × 4 KB = 64 KB per token, forever growing</text>
              </svg>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ===== gated deltanet ===== -->
            <div>
              <div class="mixer-head mh-lin">
                <span class="lang-en">Gated DeltaNet — linear, delta rule · × 48 layers</span>
                <span class="lang-ko">Gated DeltaNet — linear, delta rule · 48개 layer</span>
              </div>
              <div class="hyb-scroll">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 440 660" role="img" aria-label="Gated DeltaNet block: RMSNorm, q k v projections of 16 key and 48 value heads of 128 dims, short causal convolution, L2 norm, delta-rule state update with constant-size state matrix, output gate, output projection" style="width:100%; height:auto; min-width:400px;">
                <g data-tip="Same input as the full-attention mixer." data-tip-ko="full-attention mixer와 동일한 입력.">
                  <rect class="sbox" x="100" y="12" width="240" height="40" rx="9"></rect>
                  <text class="stitle" x="220" y="29" text-anchor="middle">X — hidden states</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="220" y="45" text-anchor="middle">[L × 5,120] BF16</text>
                </g>
                <line class="flowline" x1="220" y1="52" x2="220" y2="68" marker-end="url(#arrH)"></line>

                <g data-tip="Pre-norm RMSNorm before the projections." data-tip-ko="projection 앞의 pre-norm RMSNorm.">
                  <rect class="sbox sbox-warm" x="100" y="70" width="240" height="30" rx="8"></rect>
                  <text class="stitle sm" x="220" y="89" text-anchor="middle">RMSNorm</text>
                </g>

                <path class="flowline-thin" d="M220,100 V114 H74 V128" fill="none"></path>
                <line class="flowline-thin" x1="220" y1="114" x2="220" y2="128"></line>
                <path class="flowline-thin" d="M220,114 H366 V128" fill="none"></path>

                <g data-tip="q: 5,120 → 16 heads × 128 = 2,048 (10.5 M). Queries read the state." data-tip-ko="q: 5,120 → 16 heads × 128 = 2,048 (10.5 M). query가 state를 읽는다.">
                  <rect class="sbox" x="12" y="130" width="124" height="58" rx="9"></rect>
                  <text class="stitle sm" x="74" y="150" text-anchor="middle">q 5120→2048</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="74" y="166" text-anchor="middle">16 heads × 128</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="74" y="180" text-anchor="middle">10.5 M</text>
                </g>
                <g data-tip="k: 5,120 → 16 heads × 128 = 2,048 (10.5 M). Each key head is shared by 3 value heads (48 / 16)." data-tip-ko="k: 5,120 → 16 heads × 128 = 2,048 (10.5 M). key head 하나를 value head 3개가 공유 (48 / 16).">
                  <rect class="sbox" x="158" y="130" width="124" height="58" rx="9"></rect>
                  <text class="stitle sm" x="220" y="150" text-anchor="middle">k 5120→2048</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="220" y="166" text-anchor="middle">16 heads × 128</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="220" y="180" text-anchor="middle">10.5 M</text>
                </g>
                <g data-tip="v: 5,120 → 48 heads × 128 = 6,144 (31.5 M). Alongside q/k/v, tiny per-head projections produce the decay gate α_t and write strength β_t." data-tip-ko="v: 5,120 → 48 heads × 128 = 6,144 (31.5 M). q/k/v와 함께 head별 소형 projection이 decay gate α_t와 write strength β_t를 만든다.">
                  <rect class="sbox" x="304" y="130" width="124" height="58" rx="9"></rect>
                  <text class="stitle sm" x="366" y="150" text-anchor="middle">v 5120→6144</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="366" y="166" text-anchor="middle">48 heads × 128</text>
                  <text class="smono" x="366" y="180" text-anchor="middle">31.5 M · +α, β gates</text>
                </g>

                <line class="flowline-thin" x1="74" y1="188" x2="74" y2="206"></line>
                <line class="flowline-thin" x1="220" y1="188" x2="220" y2="206"></line>
                <line class="flowline-thin" x1="366" y1="188" x2="366" y2="206"></line>

                <g data-tip="Short causal Conv1d, kernel 4 (linear_conv_kernel_dim), depthwise over the 10,240 q/k/v channels — cheap local mixing in place of positional encoding. Its rolling buffer is 4 × 10,240 values ≈ 80 KB." data-tip-ko="짧은 causal Conv1d, kernel 4 (linear_conv_kernel_dim), q/k/v 10,240개 채널에 depthwise — positional encoding을 대신하는 값싼 local mixing. rolling buffer는 4 × 10,240 값 ≈ 80 KB.">
                  <rect class="sbox sbox-warm" x="12" y="208" width="416" height="28" rx="8"></rect>
                  <text class="ssub" x="220" y="226" text-anchor="middle">causal Conv1d (kernel 4, depthwise, 10,240 ch) + SiLU</text>
                </g>

